kvctl reference
===============

Version 2.4. See also: [kvd(8)](kvd.html).

Options
-------

`--endpoint` URL
:   The server to talk to. Defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:2379`.

`--timeout`
:   How long to wait for a reply.

    Accepts units: `500ms`, `2s`, `1m`.

--dry-run

Exit codes
----------

Exit codes of kvctl

| Code | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| 0 | Success |
| 1 | Usage error; see `kvctl --help` |
| 69 | Server ~~down~~ unavailable |

Limits
------

|  |  |
| --- | --- |
| Key size | 1 KiB |
| Values over 1 MiB are rejected with E2BIG. | |
| bad colspan | zero |

Keyboard
--------

Press `Ctrl`+`C` to cancel; x2 means squared;
H2O is water. "Quoted" text, ~~struck~~ text.

![Architecture](arch.svg)


Figure 1: **request flow**

Demo: [![the demo video](demo.jpg)](demo.mp4)
![poster only](only-poster.jpg)
[sources](a.webm)
no source at all

