## History

The topic predates the protocol. In 1988, Lynch, Dwork and Stockmeyer had demonstrated
the solvability of consensus in a broad family of "partially synchronous" systems.

## Basic Paxos

### Phase 1

Prepare
:   A _Proposer_ creates a message, which we call a "Prepare", identified with a number _n_.

Promise
:   An _Acceptor_ waits for a _Prepare_ message.

1. __[^](#cite_ref-1)__ Lamport, Leslie (1998).
2. __[^](#cite_ref-2)__ Lamport, Leslie (2001). _Paxos Made Simple_.
